== migrate diff, CONTROL (DB before the SP3 migration -> edited schema.prisma) ==
Deviation from the plan's wording: the plan says to run this "before Step 3", but before Step 3 the
schema has no SP3 block, so the command could never print CREATE TABLE and the control could not fail.
It was run after Step 3 (schema edited) and before migrate deploy, which is the comparison that can
show the difference.
$ DATABASE_URL=postgresql://probe:probe-local@localhost:55533/probe npx prisma migrate diff --config libs/backend/database/prisma.config.ts --from-config-datasource --to-schema libs/backend/database/prisma/schema.prisma --script
